brand: Lib Tech
manufacturer: Mervin Manufacturing
model name: Apex Orca II
model year: 2027
AUD price: $2,199.99
availability: Preorder
estimated availability date: May 1, 2026
board type: Freeride-Powder
rider level: Advanced
flex: 6/10 (1=soft, 10=stiff)
shape: Tapered Directional (tail narrower than nose for enhanced control and stability in deeper snow, improved floatation in powder)
camber type: Orca C2x Directional (lengthened camber in nose and tail with shortened rocker in nose for extreme control, precision, and float)
width: Standard
mounting pattern: 2x4 Inserts
available lengths: 153cm, 156cm, 159cm
sizing recommendation: Ride 3-6cm shorter than normal board due to volume shift
pro rider association: Travis Rice
topsheet: Eco Sublimated Bio Beans Topsheet (eco-friendly sublimation and adhesive, strong and environmentally friendly)
laminate: Unidirectional Carbon, 30° Carbon Mega X, Magnesium Techno Fiber Bands
laminate detail: Light and strong carbon fiber running tip to tail for stiffness, pop, and power; 14 strands of carbon fiber at 30° for torsional rigidity; high magnesium content glass fiber for tensile strength without excess weight
core: TP - Techno Pop Construction Core (lightest, most environmentally nice, and liveliest construction Lib Tech makes)
core composition: 30% Aspen, 25% Paulownia, 45% Recycled PET Plastic Bottles
sidewall: Birch Internal, UHMW Sintered Sidewall (durable high-impact ultra-high molecular weight polyethylene for exceptional impact resistance, superior resilience, and smooth damped ride)
base: Sintered Knife Cut Base (fast sintered material with die-cut base to reduce waste)
edges: Magne-Traction (seven strategically placed serrations along edges for grip in any condition)
tip/tail protection: UHMW Tip/Tail Impact Deflection (edge removed around nose and tail, replaced with UHMW material for easy repair and reduced swing weight)
weight reduction: Lightweight Spin Slim (tapered tip and tail for lighter board and less swing weight)
tip/tail construction: Anti-Matter (3-D carbon reinforced and spin weight reducing absence of material in tip and tail)
tail design: Switch friendly power kink tail
